# The soname and the full version are globbed rather than spelled out: these
# listed 0.1.23 explicitly, so the first version bump left
# libqgcodeeditor_qt6.so.0.1.24 claimed by nothing and dh_missing aborted the
# build. debian/rules copies these into the runtime and -dev packages with the
# same glob, so there is nothing here to keep in step with the version.
